   6. The one remaining gate

   The entire framework, honestly assessed, is: a correct, non-standard \
restatement of the holographic/thermodynamic-gravity frontier. Accurate
   vocabulary, zero derived predictions.

   The single thing that would move it from restatement to physics:

   \[VerticalLine] Derive one number \[LongDash] G, \[Alpha], or m_e/m_p \
\[LongDash] from the anchored equations (Bekenstein bound + \
Margolus\[Dash]Levitin + S = A/4\[ScriptL]_P\.b2), stated before looking it up.

   Jacobson passed this (derived Einstein's equations). Verlinde attempted it \
(contested). The framework has not yet attempted it.

