 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"53d0a548-43ce-7e48-81b5-0646a32cbf73"],
 "\nThis is philosophically and mathematically fertile. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"A3. Falsifiability pressure\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"c74f5664-a335-0244-80c6-c07794c4024d"],
 "\nThe best part of the recent work is that some claims were actually pushed \
into ",
 StyleBox["measurable contact",
