   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"aa1087c1-7510-d34e-b437-bf2ac2d4410a"],
 "\nThe quoted summary is strong because it does all three of these \
correctly: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"It acknowledges what is real\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
